     mmuuggee — Microchip LAN78xx USB Gigabit Ethernet driver

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     To load the driver as a module at boot time, place the following line in
     loader.conf(5):

           if_muge_load="YES"

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The mmuuggee device driver provides support for USB Gigabit Ethernet adapters
     based on Microchip's LAN78xx and LAN7515 chipsets.

     For more information on configuring this device, see ifconfig(8).

HHAARRDDWWAARREE
     The mmuuggee driver supports:

     ••   Microchip LAN7800 USB 3.1 Gigabit Ethernet controller with PHY
     ••   Microchip LAN7850 USB 2.0 Gigabit Ethernet controller with PHY
     ••   Microchip LAN7515 USB 2 hub and Gigabit Ethernet controller with PHY

SSEEEE AALLSSOO
     arp(4), miibus(4), usb(4), ifconfig(8)

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The mmuuggee device driver first appeared in FreeBSD 12.0.

